 157               / THE SECOND NUMBER IS NO. OF BLANK LINES FROM LAST PRINTED
 158               /   LINE TO "BOTTOM" SECTION OF BLANK LINES.
 159               / THE TOTAL NUMBER OF LINES AT TOP OR BOTTOM IS 6.
